Package: learnrTrackR
Title: Track Simulated learnr Tutorial Attempts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Aurélien", "Nicosia", , "116816597+AurelienNicosiaULaval@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides SQLite and optional PostgreSQL storage for tracked
    tutorial attempts. The package records submitted answers, attempt metadata,
    grading outcomes, score summaries, Moodle-ready exports, dashboard data,
    privacy utilities, and pedagogical reports for early prototyping of
    tracked learnr-style teaching workflows.
